<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila central bank details portfolio investments.</title>
<headline>Manila central bank details portfolio investments.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net portfolio investment flows of four selected foreign banks in the Philippines as of July 11 when the peso was effectively devalued by the central bank (in million dollars):</p>
<p> Custodian Bank   Week of  Week of	YTD 1997	 YTD 1996</p>
<p>			July 11   July 4     As of July 11  As of July 12</p>
<p> Hongkong Bank    -34.7     44.8	 631.2		472</p>
<p> Citibank	    -2.7	3.9	  25.8		234</p>
<p> StandardChart    -11.9     -1.1	 -81.4		116</p>
<p> Deutsche Bank	1.7	3.7	  90		  207</p>
<p> TOTAL		-47.6     51.3	 665.6	    1,029</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
